Rust dependencies
-----------------
Chanto is built on open-source Rust crates, each under a permissive license
(MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, ...). deny.toml restricts the dependency graph to
those licenses and CI runs `cargo deny check`. To ship a release, generate the
full dependency/license inventory with `cargo about generate about.hbs` (or
`cargo deny list`) and distribute that output with the binaries.


